WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.667
Okay!

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.333
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:03.867
A.

00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:04.400
Hockey,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:04.900
B.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.433
Soccer,

00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:05.967
C.

00:00:05.967 --> 00:00:06.500
Banana,

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.567
or D.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:08.100
Tennis?

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.167
Five seconds!

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:15.533
TIME'S UP!

00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:17.167
The answer is...

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:17.567
C,

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:17.967
banana!

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:18.400
Soccer,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:18.800
tennis,

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.400
and hockey are sports.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.433
A banana is a fruit,

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:24.433
so it does not belong.

00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:26.000
Here's one,

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.567
a picture puzzle!

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:30.700
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.233
A.

00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:31.733
Bottom-right,

00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:32.267
B.

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:32.800
Top-right,

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.300
C.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:33.833
Center,

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:34.867
or D.

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:35.400
Top-left?

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.433
Five seconds!

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:42.800
TIME'S UP!

00:00:43.233 --> 00:00:44.500
The answer is...

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:44.933
D,

00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:45.367
top-left!

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.067
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.367
around the corners,

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.900
so the next spot is top-left.

00:00:51.433 --> 00:00:52.600
Here's one,

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.367
a number series!

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:54.933
Four,

00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:55.533
seven,

00:00:55.533 --> 00:00:56.100
eleven,

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:56.700
sixteen,

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.267
twenty-two,

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.433
and then...

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:00.200
what comes next?

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:00.800
A.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.367
Thirty-two,

00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:01.967
B.

00:01:01.967 --> 00:01:02.533
Twenty-eight,

00:01:02.533 --> 00:01:03.133
C.

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:03.700
Thirty-one,

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.867
or D.

00:01:04.867 --> 00:01:05.467
Twenty-nine?

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:06.633
Five seconds!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:12.967
TIME'S UP!

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.567
The answer is...

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:14.967
D,

00:01:14.967 --> 00:01:15.367
twenty-nine!

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:17.700
The gaps grow by the same

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:18.867
amount each step,

00:01:18.867 --> 00:01:21.233
so the next number is twenty-nine.

00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:22.067
So,

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:23.667
are you smart or fart?

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.633
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:25.633 --> 00:01:26.600
find your rank!

00:01:27.133 --> 00:01:27.400
So,

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.533
how did you do?

00:01:28.533 --> 00:01:29.633
Comment your score below,

00:01:29.633 --> 00:01:30.733
and follow for more!
